modelDescription: |-
  Creates DRAFT plans for an existing PAUSED run. Requires DiscoveryRunID, new PlanVersion, TargetYear, 1–10 semicolon-separated QueryPackKeys, and TargetGeography. PlanningNotes optional.

  Optional EventStartDate and EventEndDate must both be supplied as YYYY-MM-DD within TargetYear, with end on or after start; otherwise omit both.

  Packs must be enabled, use TAVILY_API, match geography, and have SPECIFIC year mode with {{YEAR}} templates. Expands {{YEAR}} and appends supplied event dates. Dates guide search; they do not enforce filtering or verify event facts.

  Saves DRAFT items with reserved QueryRunIDs and MaxResults 5. Does not request approval, execute searches, change run status, or update PlannedQueryCount.

  Never invent pack keys or automatically retry with another version after blocked or uncertain outcomes. Confirm creation only for DRAFT_PLAN_CREATED, then retrieve the saved plan for review.
outputs:
  - propertyName: draftdiscoveryplanresult

